  "bodyHash": "c46172516412f71c",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Combat Nouveau 為您帶來來自 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fJava_Edition_Combat_Tests\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mojang 的戰鬥測試</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">的部分功能。體驗精進過的戰鬥機制，不止於此！此外還有許多新增的變更與設定選項。當然，所有內容均可依您的需求完全自訂。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">切換快捷欄中的物品不會觸發攻擊冷卻時間。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊未命中目標時不會觸發攻擊冷卻時間（預設關閉）。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可停用冷卻時間過低時的攻擊。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按住攻擊按鈕可連續攻擊（預設關閉）。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">劍、農具與三叉戟的攻擊範圍增加，意味著您可以從更遠處攻擊目標（預設攻擊範圍並未像戰鬥測試快照那樣減少，仍維持在 3.0 格而非 2.5 格）。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">魚、兔子、蠹魚及幼年生物等小型生物的碰撞箱會放大至至少 0.9 格。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掃擊攻擊需要「銳利」附魔，且造成的傷害僅為平常的一半，即使未命中目標（即打空）也會發動。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">盾牌能正確擊退攻擊者（實際上是修復了原版漏洞）。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">雪球、雞蛋與藥水的堆疊數量上限已增加。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">飲用藥水、牛奶與瓶裝液體等物品的速度大幅加快。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">丟擲雞蛋與雪球時會加入極短的延遲。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">受到攻擊時會中斷進食與飲用動作。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">盾牌激活後可立即使用，無需等待任何延遲（原版通常有 0.25 秒延遲）。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">盾牌的防護角度縮減至 100 度。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">被投射物擊中不再提供短暫的傷害免疫。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">命中目標時不會停止衝刺，游泳時戰鬥尤其好用（因為游泳本質上就是水中的衝刺）。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">某些物品（如不死图腾）在副手閒置握持時可隱藏顯示。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用盾牌時會顯示類似攻擊冷卻時間的指示圖標。</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客戶端與伺服器皆需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於 Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模組支援，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（Fabric 版需安裝由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 開發的 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 也是必要條件。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案均位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 資料夾內，檔名分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，具體取決於設定檔類型。並非每個模組都會包含所有類型的檔案，甚至可能完全沒有。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/convenient-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-plaques\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mobplaques/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tradingpost/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-lassos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/moblassos/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-infuser\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
